      "writtenOn": "2023-03-16T11:46:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of having this map, could you have mLocalOnlyInterfaces and mTetheredInterfaces be ArrayMap\u003cString, Integer\u003e, and have mTetherInterfaceSockets indexed by interface index ?\n\nBasically only the onLocalOnlyInterfacesChanged, onTetheredInterfacesChanged callbacks use address names. You\u0027d get the diff of added/removed interface indexes based on mLocalOnlyInterfaces and mTetherInterfaceSockets, and everything else uses interface indexes for tethering interfaces.\n\nI think this would minimize conversion from/to interface index/name, and simplify methods like maybeUpdateTetheringSocketAddress and retrieveAndNotifySocketFromInterface",
      "revId": "e63e650c06b77df2924a046a4535e950a07ca54e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
